00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:26.619
And as we often say, we never have money for
healthcare.

00:00:26.619 --> 00:00:31.169
We never have money for education, but we
always seem to have money for war and for

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:36.300
missiles and for contracts, for, uh, defense
contractors and all of that stuff.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.340
And it's happening now.

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:39.680
It's happening front and center right now.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:46.680
