Saddam wasn't linked to nine 11 is another

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:01.620
example of that.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:05.710
And so there's really a lot to learn from
this as we panic and try to prevent Donald

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.789
Trump from starting another war.

00:01:07.789 --> 00:01:13.149
Over the last year we've seen the debate about
healthcare explode, single payer healthcare

00:01:13.149 --> 00:01:15.899
proposals of different kinds have been put
forward.

00:01:15.899 --> 00:01:21.090
Medicare for all a very prominent example
of a single payer healthcare program and you

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.490
have a lot of people on the right and left
because the left always cares about how much

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:26.490
