00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:28.189
We just have answers for those questions.

00:01:28.189 --> 00:01:31.170
There has been a question of how much will
Medicare for all costs?

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:35.549
Well, what where will we save and where will
we need new money and how much do we spend

00:01:35.549 --> 00:01:39.109
per person now what would we spend under Medicare
