00:01:39.109 --> 00:01:42.259
What's the additional cost versus what we're
already spending?

00:01:42.259 --> 00:01:46.930
What kind of a payroll tax would we need on
employees and employers to get it all to balance

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:47.930
out?

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:48.930
So on and so forth.

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:54.460
These are all very good questions which the
